"⟪k:0⟫I was finally able to return to the capital with Michel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫To see my family again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Finalmente era capaz de voltar para a capital com Michel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫De ver minha família "
